      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city grew around the Canadian Pacific Railway; the railroad’s path was chosen by Lieutenant‑Governor Edgar Dewdney, moving the station to what is now downtown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
